---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Report status" showIntro={false} description="Private access to the status of your NullTopic report.">
 <section class="report-status-page">
  <div class="report-status-grid"><article class="report-status-tile report-status-information"><div class="report-status-tile-heading"><h1>Report status</h1><div class="report-status-toolbar" role="group" aria-label="Report status"><button id="report-status-refresh" class="admin-icon-button" type="button" aria-label="Refresh" data-tooltip="Refresh"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 7v5h-5M4 17v-5h5M6 7a7 7 0 0 1 12-1l2 3M4 15l2 3a7 7 0 0 0 12-1"/></svg></button><button id="report-stop-emails" class="admin-icon-button" type="button" aria-label="Stop report emails" data-tooltip="Stop report emails" hidden><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 5h18v14H3zm0 0 9 7 9-7M3 3l18 18"/></svg></button></div></div>
  <p id="report-status-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
  <div id="report-status-details" hidden><ol id="report-status-timeline" class="report-status-timeline"></ol></div></article>
  <aside class="report-status-tile report-status-help"><span class="report-status-help-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3 3 7v6c0 5 9 8 9 8s9-3 9-8V7l-9-4Z"/><path d="M12 8v4m0 4h.01"/></svg></span><h2>Questions and remedies</h2><p>For questions or a challenge to a decision, contact us and refer to your report status link. Statutory remedies remain unaffected.</p><a id="report-contact" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="report-contact-button" href="mailto:jacktoolsnet@gmail.com?subject=NullTopic%20%E2%80%93%20Report%20status" translate="no"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="m3 6 9 7 9-7"/></svg><span>jacktoolsnet@gmail.com</span></a><p>The status remains available while the case is retained. After deletion, the link no longer provides access.</p></aside></div>
 </section>
</Layout>
<script>import {initializeReporterStatus} from '../scripts/reporter-status';initializeReporterStatus();</script>
